end="0:26.363">but</span> <span begin="0:26.363" end="0:27.485">gone</span></p><p begin="0:28.325" end="0:33.122" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:28.325" end="0:28.665">'Cause</span> <span begin="0:28.665" end="0:28.937">all</span> <span begin="0:28.937" end="0:29.056">the</span> <span begin="0:29.056" end="0:29.684">dreams</span> <span begin="0:29.684" end="0:29.795">that</span> <span begin="0:29.795" end="0:30.237">she</span> <span begin="0:30.237" end="0:30.618">had</span> <span begin="0:30.618" end="0:31.077">turned</span> <span begin="0:31.077" end="0:31.457">out</span> <span begin="0:31.457" end="0:31.705">to</span> <span begin="0:31.705" end="0:32.036">be</span> <span begin="0:32.167" end="0:33.122">wrong</span></p><p begin="0:34.349" end="0:37.364" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:34.349" end="0:34.550">So</span> <span begin="0:34.550" end="0:34.807">keep</span> <span begin="0:34.807" end="0:34.940">your</span> <span begin="0:34.940" end="0:35.379">head</span> <span begin="0:35.379" end="0:35.580">up,</span> <span begin="0:35.580" end="0:35.809">prin</span><span begin="0:35.809" end="0:36.020">cess, '</span><span begin="0:36.020" end="0:36.171">fore</span> <span begin="0:36.171" end="0:36.299">your</span> <span begin="0:36.299" end="0:36.669">crown</span> <span begin="0:36.669" end="0:37.364">falls</span></p><p begin="0:37.492" end="0:40.062" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:37.492" end="0:37.601">Know</span> <span begin="0:37.601" end="0:37.773">these</span> <span begin="0:37.773" end="0:37.944">voi</span><span begin="0:37.944" end="0:38.184">ces</span> <span begin="0:38.184" end="0:38.352">in</span> <span begin="0:38.352" end="0:38.515">your</span> <span begin="0:38.515" end="0:38.650">head</span> <span begin="0:38.650" end="0:38.792">will</span> <span begin="0:38.792" end="0:38.974">be</span> <span begin="0:38.974" end="0:39.133">your</span> <span begin="0:39.133" end="0:39.623">down</span><span begin="0:39.623" end